        "original_id": "cc466e8b-80a4-5112-b1ba-c533392a2b6b",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Frank Darabont, Stephen King, Alexa Davalos, IronE Singleton\n- Works: The Shawshank Redemption, The Green Mile, The Mist, Angel, The Chronicles of Riddick, Feast of Love, Defiance, Clash of the Titans, The Walking Dead\n- Roles: T-Dog, Gwen Raiden\n- Topics: Film adaptations, directing, acting, television series\n\nFacts:\n- Frank Darabont is known as a director for film adaptations of Stephen King works, including The Shawshank Redemption, The Green Mile, and The Mist.\n- Alexa Davalos had her breakthrough role as Gwen Raiden in the fourth season of Angel from 2002 to 2003.\n- Alexa Davalos appeared in The Chronicles of Riddick in 2004.\n- Alexa Davalos appeared in Feast of Love in 2007.\n- Alexa Davalos appeared in The Mist in 2007.\n- The Mist was written and directed by Frank Darabont.\n- Alexa Davalos appeared in Defiance in 2008.\n- Alexa Davalos appeared in Clash of the Titans in 2010.\n- Frank Darabont created the character T-Dog for The Walking Dead.\n- IronE Singleton portrayed T-Dog in The Walking Dead.",
